    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄζω</span></b>  (B), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cry</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆ</span>, <i>groan, sigh</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				980
			</span></i>; so perh. in 
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τις . . ἄζηται κραδίην ἀκαχήμενος</span>”
